cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite Portable Rights and preserve the attribution of the projects in its research lineage."

title: "Portable Rights"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Santana dos Santos"
    given-names: "Felipe Gustavo"

version: 0.1.0

date-released: 2026-10-09

license: Apache-2.0

repository-code: "https://github.com/sstm-research/portable_rights"

url: "https://github.com/sstm-research/portable_rights"

abstract: >-
  Portable Rights is a research evolution of Portable Trust focused on
  creator rights, artwork provenance, ownership transfers, resale events
  and interoperable rights infrastructure. It emerged after the Legallery
  implementation developed during the EAG Global Buildathon in
  Florianópolis.

keywords:
  - portable trust
  - creator rights
  - artwork provenance
  - resale rights
  - direito de sequência
  - digital identity
  - verifiable credentials
  - attestations
  - Ethereum
  - physical-digital
  - artwork passport

